    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Look here, Holst!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "You've got to hand it to Cl\u00e9ment. He really planted the flowers in front of the statue, prettier than anywhere else."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "I'm surprised Stefano was okay with it, digging a hole in the sacrarium floor, searching for the right dirt, all that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Take it easy. You're injured."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "It's just a little scratch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Even little scratches can get worse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "And call me Gerald."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Alright, alright. You're starting to nag like Stefano."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "That's why his face is all wrinkly. Don't end up like him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Worry less, meddle less. That's the key to a long life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Don't say that. Stefano wants the best for the abbey."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "It's thanks to him that we get to live here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "I know, I'm just saying he worries too much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "I'm afraid it'll become too much for him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Stefano is considered stubborn, even amongst the Sankta. He won't budge on what he thinks is right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "But that's one of the reasons we've found refuge here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "He says the Sarkaz are just like other people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "And he's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Well, you and I, we'll have his back if things become too much for him. We'll repay our debt."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "And stop thinking about what happened in the past. We turned our backs on Theresa when we left Kazdel. We can't go back, Gerald."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Neither of us can."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "...I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "You don't need to remind me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "I don't remember when I stopped believing in Her Highness's vision... I couldn't see the future of the Sarkaz in our two rulers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "It's okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "I'm fine. We have a new life now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "I led those who wanted to leave away from Kazdel. I'll take responsibility."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Life is much better than it used to be."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Be careful. We don't have the same resources we did before, and there are some tough customers among those bandits."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Aren't you being a little too careful?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "How long will it take for the infamous mercenary to become a humble hunter out in the middle of nowhere? Five? Ten? Hahaha!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Haha..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "...Gerald."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "Have you really thought about what you'll look like when you put down your weapons for real, and settle in as a humble hunter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eileen",
        "text": "What will I look like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "No, I've never thought about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "What will I look like...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gerald",
        "text": "You'll see for yourself, Eileen."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
