    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "...Dawn has broken."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "It seemed like a lot has happened, but then it also seemed like it all happened in the blink of an eye."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "It was a long night, wasn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Nothing worthy of your time, Senior Federico."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "I just wanted to find a flower. Gerald shouldn't go to see Eileen empty-handed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "But it looks like the fire last night burned everything. There's nothing left."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "If it's just a flower you want, you wouldn't need to come here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "You don't understand, Senior Federico. It's not the same."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "The flowers here were different. A special breed grown only in this monastery."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "They represent friendship and hope."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Yes, friendship and hope. The abbot told me they were a symbol of Laterano's partnership with Iberia, one of the abbey's most important possessions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Beautiful. I was struck, immediately."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "There used to be flowerbeds all over the abbey, covering every inch when you looked down from the bell tower during bloom season."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Eileen loved the sight of it. So did Gerald."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Many were scared to talk to the Sarkaz. But they got along a lot better after the first bloom season."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "People realized that the cruel and warlike Sarkaz would stop to take a look when they passed by the flowerbeds. They would take a flower or two to put in their homes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "They weren't fearsome desperados. They were no different from us."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "There is one here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Ah, you mean the one beneath the statue."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "I saw it. It was lucky to lie beneath the statue when it fell."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "But it's not the one I wanted."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Look at it. Don't you see?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "It may have hid itself beneath the statue, but its stem is broken, and its petals are burned."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "But it's still here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "I used to believe there were things that would survive, no matter the adversity. You may laugh, but I truly did."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Life wasn't easy, but all was good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Amita Nina would make snacks for the kids when she has the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Have you ever heard of herb pizzelle?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Amita Nina and Hyman made them from a Lateran recipe using Sarkaz herbs. A dessert that everyone loved, one that belonged to this abbey, and this abbey alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Amita Nina used to say that tasting bitter fruit is all well and good, but the children should grow up knowing more than bitterness."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "They should know what sweetness tastes like."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "I will commit this dessert to memory."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Ha. It's not important. We forgot the taste of sweetness a long time ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "No one makes pizzelle anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "I find myself curious at times."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "If Sankta weren't so special, if everyone in Laterano was mundane, normal, insignificant as I am..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Would the Holy City still look the same?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Would Laterano be Laterano?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "...I don't know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "That's a shame."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Cl\u00e9ment..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Do you no longer have faith? Have your beliefs changed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "I was just made to see reality."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Things are not as immutable as people think. Testing them only harms them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "One little flaw, one little imperfection, one tiny, little wound, and it's broken beyond repair."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Like the flower you found."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "The flower I'm looking for is no longer here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_924_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "It's almost time for Matins. I should go."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment",
        "text": "Goodbye, Senior Federico."
    },
